        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b140039-cAGR64s5lOBe.png"
        },
        "description": "Rin Nanakura is the main protagonist of Pseudo Harem. She is a part of Kouban High's drama club and uses her acting skills to tease her fellow club member, [Eiji Kitahama](https://anilist.co/character/140040), with various personas in hopes of making him fall for her.\n\nShe has a friendly personality, although she is somewhat shy about her feelings for her crush, leading her to adopt a pseudo-personality for his enjoyment. She can also make others laugh and enjoy laughing herself.\n\nRin is a highly skilled actress who can imitate various personality types of girls for Eiji, including cheeky, tsundere, \"cool,\" and cute. She's also a hard worker.",
